%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah... I think I'm okay.\d%K%P
「啊啊…已经没事了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
Those words weren't entirely honest.%K%P
这句话其实并不全是真的。%K%P
The touch of her skin made me calm down.\nEmbracing her soothed my soul.\nKissing her dispelled all my worries.%K%P
跟麻实在一起，就会冷静了。\n抱着麻实，就被治愈了。\n亲吻麻实，就能安心了。%K%P
But the thorn was still stuck in my heart.\nMy pain had been alleviated, but not completely expunged.%K%P
可是…心中的刺还是没有拔出来。\n不停的刺痛虽然变得缓和了，但还是没有消除。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry, Asami.\nI forced myself on you out of nowhere...\d%K%P
「对不起，麻实。\n我这么乱来…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat? Was that your idea of being forceful?\d%K%P
「什么啊理？\n你觉得那是乱来？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Ah...\d%K%P
「诶，啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI... closed my eyes and zoned out there for a second.\nI mean, you weren't as assertive as I expected.\d%K%P
「我啊，是不是眼睛闭早了呢？\n因为，我以为理的嘴唇就要凑上来了，结果却比我想象的要晚」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWha... wha...?\d%K%P
「这、什么…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDid you get slower over the years?\nI wonder if it's your age.\d%K%P
「跟过去相比可是慢了一拍哦？\n果然还是年纪大了么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami?!\d%K%P
「麻实！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOr... were you reluctant to kiss a woman you've already\ndivorced?\d%K%P
「还是说…\n好马不吃回头草？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt wasn't a problem for me at all, so you don't need to\noverthink it, either.\d%K%P
「我可是一点都不在意的。\n所以理你不要想太多」%K%P
Her voice may have had a jesting tone to it, yet her gaze\nremained ice cold.%K%P
明明是在戏弄我，\n但是连一点笑意也没有…%K%P
Or rather... it felt obvious she was trying to hide\nanother emotion that was too painful for me to face head-\non. I found myself averting my gaze.%K%P
不仅如此…\n还表现出一副别有隐情的失败样子，\n感觉她非常痛苦地，不禁转开了视线。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, what am I even talking about?\nYou wouldn't be that subtle about this.\d%K%P
「啊～，不行啊。这不对啊。\n理，不是这么迟钝的啊」%K%P
Weren't the both of us equally lacking in that respect...?%K%P
我们不都是挺迟钝的么…？%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLook, don't think too hard about this...\d%K%P
「好讨厌，你想这么多的话我很困扰的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami.\d%K%P
「麻实」%K%P
Although, there was no way I could have said it out loud.%K%P
这种话，说不出口%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDid I mess up again? I thought I'd do something for you,\nbut I might have gone completely off the rails on my own\nhere...\d%K%P
「要是我们再做一次的话怎么样？\n为了理我已经做好思想准备了，来随意播种吧…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh... Those girls at the boarding house are going to be\nmad at me again. They always talk about how you make me\nlose my ability to think straight or listen to anyone\nelse...\d%K%P
「 啊～，你大概又要被公寓里的女人们骂了吧。\n只要是跟理沾边的事，我就管不到别人了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami!\d%K%P
「麻实啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...?! Y-Yes?!\d%K%P
「…\n怎、怎么了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Let's go home.\d%K%P
「…回去吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Okay.\d%K%P
「………也是」%K%P
I couldn't allow myself to wallow in her kindness any\nlonger.%K%P
不能再接着撒娇了。%K%P
I couldn't ask for more.\nI couldn't upset her life any further.%K%P
不能再接着索求了。\n也不能再接着麻烦了。%K%P
After all, it was my own responsibility to take care of\nthis pain.%K%P
毕竟，这份痛苦，只能藉由自己解决。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm, Osamu.\d%K%P
「呐，理」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIf you can't move on from this kiss alone...\nI'll have to make you return it to me one day.\d%K%P
「如果你对刚才的吻无法释怀的话…\n随时都可以还给我哦？」%K%P
